                0.78,
                0.903
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 6.7: Archimedes’ method utilising inscribed and circumscribed polygons. Can you see why this diagram of an inscribed and circumscribed hexagon tells us that π is between 3 and "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "2 { \\sqrt { 3 } }   { ? }"
                },
